.TH CSTRING_GET_MPROCS 3 "2026-07-10" "c_collections" "C Collections Library - Functions"
.SH NAME
cstring_get_mprocs \- get the memory management procedures for a string
.SH LIBRARY
C Collections (libccollections, \-lccollections)
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
#include <cstring.h>

ccol_memmgmt_procs_t *cstring_get_mprocs(cstr s);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
.nf
Returns the custom memory management procedures that were supplied when the
string was created. Returns NULL if the string is using the default
malloc/free allocators.
.fi
.SH PARAMETERS
.nf
s   String to query
.fi
.SH RETURN VALUE
.nf
Pointer to memory management procedures, or NULL if using defaults
.fi
.SH "SEE ALSO"
.BR cstring_create_full (3)
